[node name="Help" type="Label" parent="HUD/Desk"]
script = ExtResource("5_help")
text = "Left-drag the ground: move the city    Left-drag a person or taxi: pick up, flick to throw
Click: tap / knock on a wall    Double-click: fly there    Middle-drag: orbit    Wheel: zoom    Keys: WASD, Q/E, R/F    B: who is this (debug)    F1: debug panel
Hold LEFT still on the ground: miracle wheel (pick one, then click to cast it)    On a building of yours: rooms, floors, sellers, and at the Office training, loan, bury the file    On a building next to yours: Send a Rep
Lift a Rep and set them down at a door to take that building; keep the hand over a building at work and it goes faster
Inspectors (red !) walk from key buildings to your Reps and want paperwork: lift one and set him down far away to buy time
Space: pause (the hand, the wheels and the room editor still work)
Key buildings (red sign): train a Fixer at the Office and send him there; when he has opened one, send a Rep"

